description.p:
Anthropic signed the EU AI Act transparency code, and myths arrived faster than the docs. This dev separates what is confirmed about the imperceptible watermark from educated guesses, and why detection is not proof.

{ author: @SylwiaLask8977 }

https://t.co/BwZC33hxVf

Agent tool permissions are binary today: allowed or denied. This dev built an engine with four answers instead, then tested it against 83 real agents across 10 frameworks with zero mocks. Seven failures taught the most.

{ author: Debashish Ghosal }

https://t.co/Bi5M0UTEU0

Looker hosts its own MCP server now, so a 292 MB local binary collapses into a URL and a headers helper. This dev walks the Claude Code setup and is clear-eyed about where the tool set stops.

{ author: xbill + @GoogleDevExpert }

https://t.co/J1AoDdh8Zj

Nobody reads a 2000 line diff carefully. GitHub now recognizes a chain of PRs stacked on each other automatically, no extension needed, and this dev walked a real repo through it to find out what actually changed.

